###  

ansible

ansible is an it automation tool in k8s

maintain by redhat
build by google

it is an agentless tool

ansible can be used to automate configuration management tasks such as 
provisioning, appication deployment and infra management.

---
there are three main component in ansible

1. Inventory.yaml
    where we store remote servers details
    like:
    Ex.
    [webserver]
    192.284.1.100
    192.264.2.101

2. Playbook
    to install web servers on remote servers
    
    Ex.
    ---
    - name: install apache
      host: localhost

      task:
      - name: install apache
        apt:
          name: apache
          state: present 

          